{
  "title": "Apps Overview",
  "uid": "apps-overview",
  "tags": ["observability", "apps"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Serviço (HTTP)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, job)",
        "query": { "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, job)", "refId": "var-job" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Serviço (traces)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)",
        "query": { "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)", "refId": "var-service" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "container",
        "label": "Container (logs)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "definition": "label_values({job=`docker`}, container)",
        "query": { "query": "label_values({job=`docker`}, container)", "refId": "var-container" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Level (logs)",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "INFO,WARN,ERROR,FATAL,30,40,50",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Serviços DOWN",
      "description": "Quantos dos serviços filtrados estão com scrape falhando (up == 0). 0 = tudo saudável.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(up{job=~\"$job\"} == bool 0) or vector(0)", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Requisições/s",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "blue", "value": null } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Erros 5xx/s",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Taxa de erro",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(1))", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Latência p95 (geral)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 2 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Goroutines (Go)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 15, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 100 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1000 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(go_goroutine_count{job=~\"$job\"})", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Heap Go (objetos vivos)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 536870912 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1073741824 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(go_memory_classes_heap_objects_bytes{job=~\"$job\"})", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Spans/s no collector",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 21, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "purple", "value": null } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))", "instant": true }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HTTP — sinais de ouro por serviço",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Request rate por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Erros 5xx/s por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Latência p50 / p95 / p99 (todos)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p50" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p95" },
        { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p99" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Distribuição por status code",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 80, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Runtime Go — goroutines, heap e GC",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Goroutines por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "go_goroutine_count{job=~\"$job\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Heap objects por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "go_memory_classes_heap_objects_bytes{job=~\"$job\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "title": "Alocação/s (pressão de GC)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "Bps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(go_memory_allocated_bytes_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traces — TraceQL metrics, span-metrics e service graph",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Traces/s por serviço (TraceQL metrics)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" }, "query": "{resource.service.name != nil} | rate() by (resource.service.name)", "queryType": "traceql", "limit": 20 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "title": "Calls/s por serviço (span-metrics)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "title": "Spans com erro/s por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "title": "Span latency p95 por serviço",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{service}}" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 106,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs — volume, erros e tail ao vivo",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "title": "Log volume por container",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (count_over_time({job=`docker`, container=~\"$container\"}[$__interval]))", "queryType": "range", "legendFormat": "{{container}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Erros (logs)",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 33 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "{job=`docker`, container=~\"$container\", level=~\"$level\"}", "queryType": "range" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "{job=`docker`, container=~\"$container\"} |= `ERROR`", "queryType": "range" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "title": "Tail ao vivo (todos os containers filtrados)",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 33 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "{job=`docker`, container=~\"$container\"}", "queryType": "range" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 108,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Coleção & infra — o pipeline está vivo?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "title": "Scrape health (infra)",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 42 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] },
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "mergeValues": true, "showValue": "auto", "alignValue": "left", "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "up{job=~\"grafana|loki|prometheus|tempo|alloy\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "title": "Alloy — spans e metric points recebidos/s",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 42 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "spans/s" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "metric points/s" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "title": "Loki — bytes recebidos/s",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 42 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "Bps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(loki_distributor_bytes_received_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "bytes/s" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "title": "Service graph — req/s (client → server)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 42 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (client, server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{client}} → {{server}}" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 110,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Como debugar com este dashboard",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "title": "Receitas de debug",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 51 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Fluxo rápido de debug\n\n1. **Deu erro em algum lugar?** Painel **Erros (logs)** (aba de logs, com o filtro de *Container* e *Level* no topo). Toda linha de log das apps Go/TS que rodou dentro de um request carrega `trace_id` — **clique na linha e no link *TraceID*** para abrir a trace exata no Tempo.\n2. **Uma app \"tá lenta\"?** Painel **Latência p50/p95/p99** para ver se é geral ou pontual, e **Alocação/s + Goroutines** para pressão de GC/leak. Span latency p95 (por serviço) cobre o que passou pelo Tempo.\n3. **A app está de pé?** Stat **Serviços DOWN** (scrape do Prometheus) + **Scrape health** na seção de infra.\n4. **Pipeline de telemetria morreu?** Se **Spans/s no collector** e **Loki bytes/s** zerarem, o problema é no alloy/loki/tempo — não na app.\n\n## Queries prontas (Explore)\n\n| Onde | Query | Para quê |\n|---|---|---|\n| Tempo | `{resource.service.name=\"tela-api\" && status=error}` | traces com erro da tela |\n| Tempo | `{resource.service.name=~\"domain-.*\" \\|\\| span.http.route != nil}` | rotas HTTP dos domains |\n| Tempo | `{span.duration > 1s}` | tudo que passou de 1s |\n| Loki | `{job=\"docker\", container=~\"tela-api\"} \\| level=~\"ERROR\\|FATAL\"` | erros da tela (JSON) |\n| Loki | `{job=\"docker\"} \\|= \\`trace_id\\`` | só linhas com trace |\n| Prometheus | `histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))` | p99 por app |\n\n> Dica: os **filtros no topo** (Serviço HTTP, Serviço de traces, Container, Level) aplicam a todos os painéis. O time picker padrão é 6h — para o TraceQL metrics do painel de traces, janelas até 24h são aceitas pelo Tempo."
      },
      "targets": []
    }
  ]
}